So we can always rescale these m matrix by the scaling factor

56:17.000 --> 56:19.520
and have one of them receive be equal to 1.

56:19.520 --> 56:22.120
So that's why we have, indeed, the 11 degrees of freedom

56:22.120 --> 56:22.960
we want to estimate.

56:22.960 --> 56:23.460
